\" style=\"text-indent: 0;\">招标代理服务费按国家计委计价格[2002]1980号文的规定的计取，在领取成交通知书前向采购代理机构交纳。法律服务费按照成交金额的0.1%向法律服务单位缴纳（不足伍佰元的按伍佰元收取）。请供应商在测算报价时充分考虑这一因素。</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cleardom\"></div>\n<p>代理服务费金额：</p>\n<div>\n<p>合同包1： 5970元。收取对象：中标（成交）供应商。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h4><strong>七、公告期限</strong></h4>\n<p>自本公告发布之日起1个工作日。</p>\n<h4><strong>八、其他补充事宜</strong></h4>\n<div>\n<p>合同包1(山东省住房和城乡建设厅全省保交房项目现场核查):</p>\n<table  border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"4\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"height:36.4pt\">\n<th style=\"width: 40%;\">供应商</th>\n<th>资格性审查</th>\n<th>符合性审查</th><!-- \n\t\t\t\t\t\t<th th:if=\"${pa['creditScoreStatus'] != null && pa['creditScoreStatus']['technicalMerit'] != null && pa['creditScoreStatus']['technicalMerit'] == 1}\">技术得分</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<th th:if=\"${pa['creditScoreStatus'] != null && pa['creditScoreStatus']['businessScore'] != null && pa['creditScoreStatus']['businessScore'] == 1}\">商务得分</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<th th:if=\"${pa['creditScoreStatus'] != null && pa['creditScoreStatus']['creditScore'] != null && pa['creditScoreStatus']['creditScore'] == 1}\">综合诚信得分</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<th th:if=\"${pa['creditScoreStatus'] != null && pa['creditScoreStatus']['priceScore'] != null && pa['creditScoreStatus']['priceScore'] == 1}\">价格得分</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<th th:if=\"${pa['creditScoreStatus'] != null && pa['creditScoreStatus']['additionalScore'] != null && pa['creditScoreStatus']['additionalScore'] == 1}\">附加得分</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t -->\n<th>综合得分</th><!-- \n\t\t\t\t\t\t<th th:if=\"${pa['creditScoreStatus'] != null && pa['creditScoreStatus']['systemRanking'] != null && pa['creditScoreStatus']['systemRanking'] == 1}\">得分排名</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<th th:if=\"${pa['creditScoreStatus'] != null && pa['creditScoreStatus']['ranking'] != null && pa['creditScoreStatus']['ranking'] == 1}\">推荐排名</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t -->\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>山东省鲁统市场调查中心有限公司</td>\n<td>通过</td>\n<td>通过</td><!-- \n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td th:if=\"${evaluationSuppl